This licence covers the source code only.

It does NOT cover the clinical dataset. The records in
frontend/src/data/clinicalPatients.json are derived from patient data collected
at a tertiary care hospital and were pseudonymised before publication. They are
included so the demo has realistic inputs. They are not released for reuse,
redistribution or secondary analysis. See the Data section of README.md.
